<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall 1.05 bln markka in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall 1.05 bln markka in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to June 13 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to June 6  SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 59,513	60,566</p>
<p> Money market intervention     9,558	 8,154</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,916	 1,908</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,909	 1,909</p>
<p> Other				 7,699	 7,765</p>
<p> Total assets		     80,595	80,302</p>
<p>In the previous week, to June 6, reserves rose by 2.1 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
